Anatomu
Third-party material and credits

Anatomu is made of two kinds of material, under different licenses:

1. SOURCE CODE (src/, scripts/, config files): MIT License, see LICENSE.

2. ANATOMY DATA (the 3D models and texts in public/models/): NOT under the MIT License.
   It comes from the sources below and keeps their licenses: mainly CC BY-SA 4.0 and
   CC BY 4.0, with two non-commercial exceptions. If you reuse these files, keep these
   credits and the same licenses.

